      "source": "Returns the expiration time of the entity.",
      "translation": "返回实体的过期时间。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The Couchbase format for expiration time is: - for TTL <span class=\"invalid-tag\">invalid input: '&lt;'</span> 31 days (<span class=\"invalid-tag\">invalid input: '&lt;'</span>= 30 * 24 * 60 * 60): expressed as a TTL in\nseconds - for TTL &gt; 30 days: expressed as Unix UTC time of expiry (number of SECONDS since the Epoch)",
      "translation": "Couchbase 的过期时间格式如下：对于 TTL <span class=\"invalid-tag\">无效输入：'&lt;'</span> 31 天（<span class=\"invalid-tag\">无效输入：'&lt;'</span>= 30 * 24 * 60 * 60），以秒为单位的 TTL 表示；对于 TTL > 30 天，以 Unix UTC 时间的过期时间表示（自纪元起的秒数）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new entity.",
      "translation": "创建新实体。",
      "count": 2
