    {
      "source": "Flag for using getAndTouch operations for reads, resetting the expiration (if one was set) when the entity is\ndirectly read (eg. findOne, findById).",
      "translation": "用于读取时启用 getAndTouch 操作的标志，当实体被直接读取（例如 findOne、findById）时，会重置其过期时间（如果已设置）。",
      "count": 2
